{"flags":["No EV derivative launched for kushaq, slavia, or kylaq in the window; all three launches are ICE.","Kushaq facelift launch date: Mar 21, 2026 per ETAuto, CarWale update feed, carzonwheel, moneycontrol; CarWale's Oct 2026 hike article separately wrote 'MY26 iteration launched in May' (likely error) — resolved to 2026-03-21.","Kushaq Oct 2026 hike quantum conflict: cars24 headline says up to Rs 35,000, but its own table and the NDTV/rushlane/CarWale per-variant breakdowns show a max of Rs 20,000 — detailed per-variant figures used.","Kushaq Oct 2026 hike effective date: announced Sep 29 as effective Oct 1 (range-wide), variant-wise details reported ~Oct 10; recorded as 2026-10-01 with explanatory notes.","Kylaq GST-cut exact figures (e.g. Rs 7,54,651) appear computed from GST arithmetic; caronphone claims 'based on the official update' — no official Skoda price list located, so is_estimate=true on all rows.","Kushaq GST-cut: caronphone's variant-level table uses pre-facelift trim names/prices (Classic, Onyx, Monte Carlo 1.0 MT) and is stale for the Mar-2026 facelift range — only the range-level cut (up to Rs 65,828) recorded; variant-level facelift GST prices not found.","Slavia GST-cut table: source shows identical old/new prices for Monte Carlo and Prestige pairs and lists a Monte Carlo 1.0 MT; probable source errors — rows included with notes, unmatched names not dropped.","New Kushaq variant 'Sportline 1.5 TSI DSG' at Rs 16.99 lakh added ~Oct 2026 (most affordable Kushaq 1.5 TSI) has no matching verified variant — recorded, flagged.","Slavia pre-facelift GST row 'Sportline 1.5 TSI DSG' has no matching verified variant (facelift Sportline is 1.0-only) — recorded, flagged.","Kylaq Sportline, Classic+, and Prestige+ trims were added during 2026 (confirmed in NDTV Oct 2026 hike coverage); launch dates and launch prices not sourced — omitted.","No manufacturer-confirmed figures (official press release / official price list) found for any record — all is_esti